    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="structslab__arena" kindref="compound">slab_arena</ref> <ndash/> a source of large aligned blocks of memory. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>MT-safe. Uses a lock-free LIFO to maintain a cache of used slabs. Uses a lock-free quota to limit allocating memory. Never returns memory to the operating system. </para>    </detaileddescription>
